OSED1 remains a listener-startup EPERM before cases. Earlier launcher/text failures remain failed evidence. I did not repeat the whole gate or install packages. Private dependency evidence establishes only the one existing workspace devDependency delta and 13 reported physical-link checks, not a new whole-tree audit.\n\nThe raw passing gate also retains scripted reset/retention exceptions, the framework RefcountedCanceler cancellation exception and four Content-Type warnings. These are not erased by its passing totals; no triggering-actor/root-cause, masked-timeout or wider stability cure is inferred, and 1d3 remains open.\n\nThis approval closes only A2 Source child f276 on a sealed local landing. A3 remains a separate unreviewed writer/storage/token-prefix/rebuild/lost-push obligation. Fixture milestone432f, archive root e871, A4/A5, real canonical genesis/closes:merged-send history, admission/consent/disclosure, ancestry/at-send retention, progress/G1 and provider/deployment acceptance remain open. No provider operation or source/ref mutation was performed by checker.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:f16de0a6ce5d86459425d972f60db17e6012ebe7","binding":"assigned","head":"f6e94550ecbde2f60042e9a74f75680e7000d995","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:93ce6071f2af0fe2ccbb4dde4e6e3986bbca8501\",\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:37bf2ce8400aaf3bfeb7feb82bbd58056ac9f364\"]","implementations":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:ce183b147d0fed681a20cd8b670978de77e5b8b5\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:64ae1fcfa9009d38392c6f6e5cc39a8be26fdabe","review_path":"reviewguard@1","verdict":"approved"}}